# NIRF University Rankings Analysis 2024

## About
Analysis of top 100 Indian universities using official NIRF 2024 data.

## Tools Used
- Python
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- Excel

## Key Findings
- Tamil Nadu has the most top universities (22)
- IISc Bangalore is ranked #1 with score 83.29
- West Bengal has highest average score of 63.24
- Chennai is the city with most top universities (8)
